    ],
    "notes": "Deep fried and made with maida, so not a light dish. Only the maida (1 cup), ajwain and salt (1/2 tsp each), oil (3 spoons), moong dal (1 cup) and the whole spices are said in the speech; all other amounts are my estimates. I read the three pale or brown powders as coriander powder, garam masala and amchur from their colours (not said clearly). Dal soaking time is not stated (usually 2 to 3 hours, not counted in the 75 min). Frying time and flame level are not given: fry on medium heat until golden. The creator is only named in the speech, not on screen.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "t": "Put 1 cup maida in a big bowl.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-maida-1",
          "s-maida-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Add 1/2 tsp ajwain.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-ajw-1",
          "s-ajw-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Add 1/2 tsp salt.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-salt-1",
          "s-salt-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Add 3 tbsp oil.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-oil-1",
          "s-oil-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Rub the oil into the flour until it looks like crumbs.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-rub-1",
          "s-rub-2",
          "s-rub-3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Sprinkle in water little by little.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-wat-1",
          "s-wat-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Knead into a firm dough and keep it aside.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-knead-1",
          "s-knead-2",
          "s-knead-3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Take the 1 cup of soaked moong dal.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-soak-1",
          "s-soak-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Grind the dal in the mixie to a thick paste. Add water only if needed.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-grind-1",
          "s-grind-2",
          "s-grind-3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Dry roast the red chilli, cumin, fennel, coriander seeds and pepper.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-roast-1",
          "s-roast-2",
          "s-roast-3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Crush the roasted spices in a mortar.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-crush-1",
          "s-crush-2",
          "s-crush-3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Heat oil in a pan.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-fo-1",
          "s-fo-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Add the thin ginger strips and green chillies.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-gin-1",
          "s-gin-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Cook them until soft.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-sau-1",
          "s-sau-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Add the crushed spice mix.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-mas-1",
          "s-mas-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Add 1 to 2 tbsp besan and roast it until fragrant.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-bes-1",
          "s-bes-2",
          "s-bes-3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Add the dal paste and mix well.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-dal-1",
          "s-dal-2",
          "s-dal-3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Add the coriander powder and garam masala.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-cp-1",
          "s-cp-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Add the red chilli powder and turmeric.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-rc-1",
          "s-rc-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Add the amchur and salt.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-am-1",
          "s-am-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Cook, stirring, until the filling turns dry and crumbly.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-cook-1",
          "s-cook-2",
          "s-cook-3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Move the filling to a bowl and let it cool.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-cool-1",
          "s-cool-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Shape the cool filling into small balls.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-fball-1",
          "s-fball-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Knead the dough once more and take a small ball.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-dball-1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Press the dough ball into a small cup shape.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-cup-1",
          "s-cup-2",
          "s-cup-3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Put a ball of filling in the middle.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-fill-1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Close the dough over the filling and seal it.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-close-1",
          "s-close-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Press it gently flat between your palms.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-press-1",
          "s-press-2",
          "s-press-3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Heat oil in a kadhai. Gently slide in the kachoris.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-heat-1",
          "s-fry-1",
          "s-fry-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Fry until they puff up and turn golden.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-fry-3",
          "s-fry-4"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Lift them out with a slotted spoon.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-lift-1",
          "s-lift-2",
          "s-lift-3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Serve hot with curd, aloo sabzi or chutney.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-serve-1",
          "s-serve-2",
          "s-serve-3"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
